<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Torzan</h1></div><h2 class="c">Butterfly</h2><p>Butterfly<br>Such dark <br>and beautiful colors<br><br>Dancing <br>upon a grey<br>and boring sky<br><br>Sparkling<br>You shine<br>reflecting unemitted light<br><br>You stepped here<br>You stayed<br>You had to fly away<br><br>I knew that<br>Yet I was joyous<br>You appeared joyous too<br><br>But those<br>were only your colors<br>And that<br>only my sky.<br><br>And there you were<br>dancing<br>With such dark<br>and beautiful colors<br><br>Dancing<br>upon my grey<br>and boring sky</p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"><h2 class="c">My Secret</h2><p>I am not crazy.<br>I am not sane.<br>Just travel on a journey,<br>Climb inside my brain.<br>And you will see the beauty of<br>The dark and cold wet rain,<br>That is pouring heavily outside<br>My silent window pane.<br>Only then will you ever see,<br>The pain that can't be slain.</p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
